tbVJObWhoSDRMOUg2ZGh6d0hsUlB4WFF3bDJobDUxNEQ3cEN3dDhBaEl1WUlCRG1mTlNvbkJ6RVNMZ2JNTkhjSVRpckYxRnN0dkVhb3ZBQ1JsM1ZpWFdKNnNQcHdldw?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"微軟不會續簽從甲骨文租用人工智慧雲端容量的協議：報告"},{"title":"Microsoft is winding down its deal to rent AI computing from Oracle","src":"The Next Web","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNUmsxSVhhU1lYazBuVUp2UFBkSXpxdm50S2RuNFItNHJGSlNEWkdUQ1RhaldUZW4yb1BqTlN1Qy01U0lZMjRpWk5VbVVjYjF6V1owOC1CNUpTVmlVbmZ3Z3FleXJLWi1Zd0FjNXlEQ25mTkNWcVF1c1h3YVhCVlNOTFU0U1Q?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"微軟正在逐步終止從甲骨文租用人工智慧運算的交易"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":12},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":9},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":6},{"name":"資料中心","count":1},{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-06-22","period":"2026-05-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1341439/000119312526277521/orcl-20260531.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Oracle provides products and services that build, run and support enterprise information technology (IT) frameworks. Our products and services include enterprise applications and infrastructure offerings that incorporate and are enhanced by artificial intelligence (AI) technologies, including embedded AI-driven automation and analytics and generative AI capabilities. These offerings are delivered worldwide through a variety of flexible and interoperable IT deployment models. These models include cloud-based, on-premise and hybrid deployments, such as Oracle Exadata Cloud@Customer and multicloud options that enable customers to use Oracle cloud offerings in conjunction with other public clouds. We provide choice and flexibility to our customers as to when and how they deploy Oracle applications and infrastructure technologies. We believe that offering customers broad, comprehensive, flexi","zh":"Oracle 提供建置、運作和支援企業資訊技術 (IT) 架構的產品和服務。我們的產品和服務包括企業應用程式和基礎設施產品，這些產品和基礎設施產品融合了人工智慧 (AI) 技術並透過人工智慧 (AI) 技術增強，包括嵌入式人工智慧驅動的自動化和分析以及生成式人工智慧功能。這些產品透過各種靈活且可互通的 IT 部署模型在全球範圍內提供。這些模式包括基於雲端的部署、本地部署和混合部署，例如 Oracle Exadata Cloud@Customer 和多雲選項，使客戶能夠將 Oracle 雲端產品與其他公有雲結合使用。我們為客戶提供選擇和靈活性，幫助他們決定何時以及如何部署 Oracle 應用程式和基礎架構技術。我們相信，為客戶提供廣泛、全面、靈活的"},{"en":"Oracle cloud offerings include Oracle Cloud Applications (OCA) and Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI, and collectively with OCA, Oracle Cloud), which provide comprehensive and integrated applications and infrastructure services, enabling our customers to choose the best option that meets their specific business needs. Oracle Cloud integrates IT components in a cloud-based IT environment that Oracle deploys and manages for customers and is accessible by utilizing common web browsers via a broad spectrum of devices. AI technologies embedded in Oracle Cloud offerings are designed to support the improvement of our customers' existing and new workflows and business processes, including automation and data analyses. Oracle Cloud is designed to be:","zh":"Oracle 雲端產品包括 Oracle 雲端應用程式 (OCA) 和 Oracle 雲端基礎架構（OCI，統稱為 OCA、Oracle 雲端），它們提供全面且整合的應用程式和基礎架構服務，使我們的客戶能夠選擇滿足其特定業務需求的最佳選項。 Oracle 雲端將 IT 元件整合到 Oracle 為客戶部署和管理的基於雲端的 IT 環境中，並且可以透過各種裝置使用通用 Web 瀏覽器進行存取。 Oracle 雲端產品中嵌入的人工智慧技術旨在支援改善客戶現有和新的工作流程和業務流程，包括自動化和資料分析。 Oracle 雲端的設計目標是："},{"en":"connectable among differing deployment models to enable interoperability and extensibility to easily move workloads among the Oracle Cloud, multicloud and other IT environments;","zh":"可在不同的部署模型之間進行連接，以實現互通性和可擴展性，從而在 Oracle 雲端、多雲和其他 IT 環境之間輕鬆移動工作負載；"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We directly market and sell our cloud, software, hardware, support and services offerings globally to businesses of many sizes and in many industries, government agencies and educational institutions. We also market and sell our offerings globally through indirect channels.","zh":"我們直接向全球不同規模、不同產業、政府機構和教育機構行銷和銷售我們的雲端、軟體、硬體、支援和服務產品。我們也透過間接管道在全球行銷和銷售我們的產品。"},{"en":"In the United States (U.S.), our sales and services employees are based throughout the country. Outside the U.S., our international subsidiaries sell, support and service our offerings in their local countries as well as within other foreign countries where we do not operate through a direct sales subsidiary. Our geographic coverage allows us to draw on business and technical expertise from a global workforce, provides stability to our operations and revenue streams to offset geography-specific economic trends and offers us an opportunity to take advantage of new markets for our offerings. Our international operations subject us to certain risks, which are more fully described in Risk Factors included in Item 1A of this Annual Report. A summary of our domestic and international revenues and long-lived assets is set forth in Note 13 of Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements included e","zh":"在美國 (U.S.)，我們的銷售和服務員工遍佈全國各地。在美國境外，我們的國際子公司在當地以及我們不透過直銷子公司營運的其他國家/地區銷售、支援和服務我們的產品。我們的地理覆蓋範圍使我們能夠利用全球員工的業務和技術專業知識，為我們的營運和收入流提供穩定性，以抵消特定地區的經濟趨勢，並為我們提供利用我們的產品的新市場的機會。我們的國際業務使我們面臨某些風險，這些風險在本年度報告第 1A 項的風險因素中有更全面的描述。我們的國內及國際收入及長期資產的摘要載於合併財務報表附註的附註 13："}],"competition":[{"en":"We face intense competition in all aspects of our business. The nature of the IT industry creates a competitive landscape that is constantly evolving as firms emerge, expand or are acquired, as technology evolves and as customer demands and competitive pressures otherwise change.","zh":"我們業務的各個方面都面臨著激烈的競爭。 IT 產業的性質創造了一種競爭格局，隨著公司的出現、擴張或被收購，隨著技術的發展以及客戶需求和競爭壓力的變化，這種競爭格局也在不斷演變。"},{"en":"Our customers are demanding less complexity, more cost-effective and higher performance and availability in the implementation, sourcing, integration and ongoing maintenance of their IT environments. Our enterprise cloud, software and hardware offerings compete directly with certain offerings from some of the largest and most competitive companies in the world, including Adobe Systems Incorporated, Alphabet Inc., Amazon.com, Inc., Cisco Systems, Inc., Intel Corporation, International Business Machines Corporation, Microsoft Corporation, Salesforce, Inc. and SAP SE, as well as other companies like Hewlett-Packard Enterprise and Workday, Inc. In addition, due to the low barriers to entry in many of our market segments, new technologies and new and growing competitors frequently emerge to challenge our offerings. Our competitors range from companies offering broad IT solutions across many o","zh":"我們的客戶在 IT 環境的實施、採購、整合和持續維護方面要求更低的複雜性、更高的成本效益以及更高的效能和可用性。我們的企業雲端、軟體和硬體產品與世界上一些最大和最具競爭力的公司的某些產品直接競爭，包括 Adob​​​​e Systems Incorporated、Alphabet Inc.、Amazon.com, Inc.、Cisco Systems, Inc.、Intel Corporation、International Business Machines Corporation、Microsoft Corporation、Salesforce, Inc. 和 SAP SEday，以及 Hewlett-Pard Business Machines Corporation, Inc. 等其他公司。此外，由於我們許多細分市場的進入障礙較低，因此需要新技術和不斷增長的新興技術競爭對手經常出現來挑戰我們的產品。我們的競爭對手包括在許多領域提供廣泛 IT 解決方案的公司"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-05-31","items":[{"name":"Cloud & Software Business","val":58530000000,"zh":"雲端與軟體業務"},{"name":"Services Business","val":5743000000,"zh":"服務業務"},{"name":"Hardware Business","val":3084000000,"zh":"五金業務"}],"total":67357000000},"prod":{"end":"2026-05-31","items":[{"name":"Cloud Revenues","val":33989000000,"zh":"雲端收入"},{"name":"Software Revenues","val":24541000000,"zh":"軟體收入"},{"name":"Software Support","val":19804000000,"zh":"軟體支援"},{"name":"Cloud Infrastructure","val":18101000000,"zh":"雲端基礎設施"},{"name":"Cloud Applications","val":15888000000,"zh":"雲端應用"},{"name":"Software License","val":4737000000,"zh":"軟體許可"}],"total":67357000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-05-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":44478000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":39835000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":20843000000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"EMEA","val":15297000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":7582000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"GB","val":2816000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"DE","val":1993000000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"JP","val":1870000000,"zh":"日本"}],"total":67357000000}},"peers":["CSCO","IBM","INTC","QCOM","DELL"]}}